                        {
                            "kind": "wave",
                            "text": {
                                "en": "Slide up and down on a quiet \"oo\", three times, following the ribbon. Somewhere your voice will jump: that's your flip. Go only as high as feels easy, and keep the top light, like an owl's hoo, never louder."
